        "verse": 8
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "With the blast of your nostrils, the waters were piled up. The floods stood upright as a heap. The deeps were congealed in the heart of the sea.",
      "ko": "주의 콧김에 물이 쌓이되 파도가 언덕 같이 일어서고 큰 물이 바다 가운데 엉기니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "28765255d42fcb243618a8adb8c04751e3bf52ac7729a09b931e52a258c42d08",
      "translation_text_hash": "85e6ba0fcf2878bc7bb8af04b8c8c648c766750902f0cf3850fb13cd4a904597",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "주의 콧김에 물이 쌓이되 파도가 언덕 같이 일어서고 큰 물이 바다 가운데 엉기니이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "85e6ba0fcf2878bc7bb8af04b8c8c648c766750902f0cf3850fb13cd4a904597"
      ]
