      "en": "Miriam the prophetess, the sister of Aaron, took a tambourine in her hand; and all the women went out after her with tambourines and with dances.",
      "ko": "아론의 누이 선지자 미리암이 손에 소고를 잡으매 모든 여인도 그를 따라 나오며 소고를 잡고 춤추니",
      "source_text_hash": "56f0bbf144d141b98f2a8ee4e202daf2eb91aaa135350c762359c3bf09c36ede",
      "translation_text_hash": "dde483eda33d0a2504d0d81ce529d09859cb2d6e1508da57624f8e9253c06bff",
