      "en": "When they came to Marah, they couldn’t drink from the waters of Marah, for they were bitter. Therefore its name was called Marah.",
      "ko": "마라에 이르렀더니 그곳 물이 써서 마시지 못하겠으므로 그 이름을 마라라 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "6defb21670d6e3c35575fda32fc390a9cd0a916f41e35d69d3107f105a23f7a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "aaef06913a87312db663552897892c3cbc699585c1817811a445941f8e87b680",
