      "en": "The people murmured against Moses, saying, “What shall we drink?”",
      "ko": "백성이 모세를 대하여 원망하여 가로되 우리가 무엇을 마실까 하매",
      "source_text_hash": "71b8e709d9ab48b25a8c7d160bee487827c1985bd4c32b88115ef371ee8ed659",
      "translation_text_hash": "5323aa2cf28bd0c3b27f5aeda03d0df35de4132d3363af0b89974fbd1b21364e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
