        "verse": 26
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 26
        }
      ],
      "en": "He said, “If you will diligently listen to the LORD your God’s voice, and will do that which is right in his eyes, and will pay attention to his commandments, and keep all his statutes, I will put none of the diseases on you which I have put on the Egyptians; for I am the LORD who heals you.”",
      "ko": "가라사대 너희가 너희 하나님 나 여호와의 말을 청종하고 나의 보기에 의를 행하며 내 계명에 귀를 기울이며 내 모든 규례를 지키면 내가 애굽 사람에게 내린 모든 질병의 하나도 너희에게 내리지 아니하리니 나는 너희를 치료하는 여호와임이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "d1bd54561b496f1c49c8d77ab15cc61fa4c94823c3ec972d23236f3a95e18a4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "021e61258238bc4103dbfcee4d80d637c9957e823cd550d13fdac267a2e2916f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
